As a consequence, when dca cuts are applied in the analysis, the effects of these cuts on the simulation and on data have to be compared. If differences due to an underestimation of the dca in simulations are apparent the embedding results used for efficiency determination have to be corrected for this dca broadening. This is illustrated in section 5.6.1.

